# What a deploy never uploads (the safety PR, owner 2026-11-12). Production deploys come from main through git; this
# keeps secrets and local-only files out of any upload made by hand from a working tree (the CLI sends the folder).
# Only secrets and local files are listed: everything the build reads stays in.
.env
.env.*
!.env.example
*.pem
*.key
.vercel
.claude
.next
private/
.venv
.venv-*
.voice-models
narration-out
images-out
art-out
summary-out
open-call/
*.log
.DS_Store
